Type in the missing words."}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "prioritizes"}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Brad always"}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "priorities"}], "type": "incorrect"}, {"contents": {"type": "", "content": "his tasks, so he gets the most important things done. "}, "type": "post_question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_8"}]}, {"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "tends"}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Robert"}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "tens"}], "type": "incorrect"}, {"contents": {"type": "", "content": "to come in to the office very early every day. "}, "type": "post_question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_8"}]}, {"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": "help"}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 2, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Jody can't"}], "type": "question"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "helped"}], "type": "incorrect"}, {"contents": {"type": "", "content": "but make suggestions all the time. "}, "type": "post_question"}, {"type": "objective", "content": "secondary_8"}]}], "type": "GIW", "id": 9, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " What are the best ways to get the job done?"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: <span class =\"bullet\">Proofread the sentence. </span><span class =\"bullet\">Click on the incorrect word. </span><span class =\"bullet\">Type in the correct word to complete the sentence.</span><span class =\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary.</span>"}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}]}], "type": "RSLT", "id": 10, "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn6le14ob03re7pdf01.pdf"}], "type": "question"}]}], "type": "DWS", "id": 11, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Let's talk about work habits!"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "\nInstructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment.\n"}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le14ob03re2img06.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le14ob03re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le14ob03re2img06.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le14ob03re2img06.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: So, Janet. What did you think of our meeting with Ferdinand? <br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: He comes across pretty strong. Definitely charming. I'm not sure he's sincere. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I have to disagree. Clients trust him. He's credible. He was certainly animated yesterday, but he meant every word. When he's inspired, he can't help but show it. Not a bad thing."}, {"time": "23500", "image": "engenn6le14ob03re2img07.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: But he didn't care to show up on time. He thought the greenery on the mezzanine was a bigger priority. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I'm sorry, but I disagree. I think we have an example of a cultural disparity here. It wasn't the greenery that inspired Ferdinand. He makes a point of treating whomever he is with at the moment his priority. Because he prioritizes relationships, he would consider it important to be respectful to the concierge upon meeting. Of course, he does tend to be late, as you may imagine."}, {"time": "57000", "image": "engenn6le14ob03re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: The person at present is priority. I suppose that would be winsome with clients. Perhaps you can coach him on the priorities of time commitments and the colleagues or clients you keep waiting. <br/><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I agree. What would you think if I planned a presentation in cross-cultural relations and business etiquette? I think we could all benefit.\n<br/><span class=\"strong\">Janet</span>: What a good idea! I'll be there."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter at Work"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Figuring out Ferdinand "}, {"type": "position", "content": 3}, {"type": "origin", "content": "scholar > Grammar - part 3 > The Suitcase"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 14}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe routines and regular activities in a wider range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Talking about Habits"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In the Business world, it is important to talk about things that are part of your daily life. Normally, the <span class=\"strong\">Present Simple</span> is used to describe activities you do on a daily basis. You can use the following expressions to describe habits."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":5,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Expression</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Verb form</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>comes across as ... </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&#8594; usually followed by an adjective\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>can't help but ... </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&#8594; followed by \u2018verb'\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>makes a point of ... </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&#8594; followed by \u2018-ing'\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li> tends to ... </li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"&#8594; followed by \u2018verb'\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "He <span class=\"strong\">comes across as</span> very self confident."}, {"type": "example", "content": "He <span class=\"strong\">can't help but</span> be persistent."}, {"type": "example", "content": "She <span class=\"strong\">makes a point of</span> treating clients with respect."}, {"type": "example", "content": "He <span class=\"strong\">tends to</span> be punctual."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Agreeing and Disagreeing Tactfully"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "In English, when people give an opinion, it is important to show that you either agree or disagree with it. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are many different ways in which we can show agreement and disagreement in English. Here are some of them:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Agreeing</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Disagreeing</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I agree.</li><li>What a good idea.</li><li>I couldn't agree more.</li><li>I strongly agree. *</li><li>That's exactly how I feel.</li><li>Exactly.</li><li>Precisely.</li><li>You have a point there.</li></ul>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<ul><li>I have to disagree.</li><li>I'm sorry, but I disagree.</li><li>But he didn't care to ... <span class =\\\"italic\\\">(+verb)</span></li><li>Absolutely not!</li><li>Do you really believe/think that ( ... )?</li><li>I don't agree at all.</li><li>I totally disagree.</li></ul>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "* Apart from the phrases mentioned above, there are few important patterns with the word \u201cagree\u201d. Study the following:"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol><li>subject + agree + with + something / somebody. <br/>&#8594; <span class =\"italic\">I agree with you.</span></li></ol>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol start=\"2\"><li>subject + agree + that + clause (subject + verb + object)<br/>&#8594; <span class =\"italic\">I agree that the meeting should be cancelled. </span></li></ol>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The pattern \u2018adverb + agree / disagree' is also commonly used. Here are the most common adverbs used with \u201cagree\u201d or \u201cdisagree\u201d."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li><span class=\"italic\">I strongly</span>/<span class=\"italic\">completely</span>/<span class=\"italic\">totally</span>/<span class=\"italic\">absolutely disagree</span>/<span class=\"italic\">agree</span>. </li></ul>"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">I have to disagree</span> that he might not be sincere."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">I agree</span> that we should coach people on the priorities of time commitments."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "winsome"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "attractive or appealing in character"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I suppose his charm would be winsome with clients. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le14ob03aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about someone's behavior towards work."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "inspired"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to fill someone with the motivation or ability to do something positive"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When he is inspired by a project, he gets excited."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le14ob03aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "credible"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "able to be trusted"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Clients trust him. He's quite credible."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le14ob03aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to make a point of"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to stress the importance of doing something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Ferdinand always makes a point of treating his clients well."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le14ob03aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to prioritize"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to rank the importance of each task you have to do"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Ferdinand prioritizes his relationships and respects the person he's with."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le14ob03aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "animated"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "lively; full of excitement"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He was really animated because he was excited about our proposal."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le14ob03aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le14ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of 3 people you know who have a full-time job."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk to each of these people and ask them about their work habits. Write down their answers."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 3 short paragraphs about each person, include adjectives to describe them and their job. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Proofread your paragraphs. Read them aloud."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about jobs and work with 3 people I know."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write about people's habits at work."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use adjectives to write about behavior appropriate to work. "}]}]}